        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#spec" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. What the Accuracy Spec Means</a>
          <a href="#prep" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Before You Test</a>
