          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Checking laser level accuracy takes two walls, a tape measure and about twenty minutes. The two-wall test checks level, the tilt check covers the length of the line, and a plumb bob checks the vertical. Compare the results with your laser's spec scaled to the test distance, and you will know whether it can be trusted.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
